{"id":"n31329-1-7","stage":1,"title":"겉 · 外面","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31329-1-7-1","ko":"편지를 보내려고 하는데 우표는 어디에 붙여야 하나요?","zh":"我打算寄信，邮票应该贴在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"편지를","meaning":"信，书信，信件","explanation":"편지：信，书信，信件；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"편지","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24147","senseId":"1","lemma":"편지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편지를","audio":"/audio/2c9dab56a674fd28e2f8.mp3"}},{"text":"보내려고","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내려고","audio":"/audio/079364d3c2ac78e03fc5.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"우표는","meaning":"邮票","explanation":"우표：邮票；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우표","audio":"/audio/18f11c9b5117e408d559.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26680","senseId":"1","lemma":"우표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우표는","audio":"/audio/d162409111c1fdc440f1.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"붙여야","meaning":"粘，贴，粘贴","explanation":"붙이다：粘，贴，粘贴；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"붙이다","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60293","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙여야","audio":"/audio/fa773ba656bfe0f0f225.mp3"}},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나요","audio":"/audio/208badeaa54755540b4c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"53bf9898bc47c0e1","term":"편지","zh":"信，书信，信件","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3","entryId":"24147","definition":"把要说的话写下来寄给对方的文字内容。","pronunciation":["편ː지"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"送，寄","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"把人或东西等弄到别的地方去。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"18f11c9b5117e408","term":"우표","zh":"邮票","audio":"/audio/18f11c9b5117e408d559.mp3","entryId":"26680","definition":"作为缴纳邮寄费用的证明，贴在邮件上的小贴纸。","pronunciation":["우표"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"f50e3cbdb3c8dd13","term":"붙이다","zh":"粘，贴，粘贴","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3","entryId":"60293","definition":"使某物附在某处而不脱落。","pronunciation":["부치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/173a8d8a350636a1d0c3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31329-1-7-2","ko":"봉투의 겉 한 쪽에 붙이면 됩니다.","zh":"贴在信封的正面一侧就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"봉투의","meaning":"信封","explanation":"봉투：信封；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"봉투","audio":"/audio/e974d886dd5749a4dcd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59756","senseId":"1","lemma":"봉투","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"te